# Graphify

Load [`factory/skills/graphify/SKILL.md`](../../factory/skills/graphify/SKILL.md),
then follow [`factory/policy/graphify.md`](../../factory/policy/graphify.md).

Resolve the project graph from `paths.graphify_graph` and its working
directory from `paths.graphify_root` in `factory/config.yaml`. Do not fall
back to a legacy mixed graph. Skip when `tools.graphify` is false or the
selected graph does not exist, and report a missing graph.

Before source exploration, use the configured graph query command. After
code edits within `paths.graphify_sources`, use the configured refresh
command. Generated Obsidian code-map notes are navigation, not authority.
